Colleagues 3,4,8,18,19,20 converge on the same pair and cite the identical textual reconstruction. Counter-claims (25&28, 73&74, 5&7, 19&25, etc.) either mis-locate the anomaly inside a stanza whose rotation is already correct or would break the envoi pattern. No other pair satisfies both the mechanical end-word sequence and the rhetorical closure of the poem.  

Unresolved: none; the form plus the known original text converge on a single solution.}

